WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.013
[Boat motor and water]

00:04.033 --> 00:07.647
[Engine idling at the shore]

00:07.667 --> 00:11.280
[Footsteps and scattered gunfire]

00:11.300 --> 00:15.313
[Rifle fire and a pop as smoke spreads]

00:15.333 --> 00:17.447
[Tank engine rumbling]

00:17.467 --> 00:19.013
[Engine muffled inside the tank]

00:19.033 --> 00:23.013
[Cannon fire over the engine]

00:23.033 --> 00:27.047
[Helicopter rotors]

00:27.067 --> 00:30.947
[Aircraft overhead and a line of explosions]

00:30.967 --> 00:35.780
[Artillery bursts across the village]
